    test_runner_native_producer_failure_reported_as_exit_minus_one_empty_output_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. Native-route spec compiles that end in a real MIR or link error are reported by the runner as 'exit=-1, limit=infrastructure, stdout: ; stderr:' (runtime_error path, resource_scope.spl:674) although the producer wrote ~0.5 MB of diagnostics (< TEST_OUTPUT_CAPTURE_BYTES) with a classifiable verdict. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/test_runner_native_producer_failure_reported_as_exit_minus_one_empty_output_2026-11-12.md."

